{"data":[{"author_id":"1080593132482260992","created_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112602017894142060"],"id":"2112602017894142060","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":190,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🇹🇷🇬🇷 土耳其与希腊：过去100年出生人口的惊人变化！\n\n1926年：\n🇹🇷 土耳其约62.5万人\n🇬🇷 希腊约18.1万人\n土耳其是希腊的3.45倍\n\n2025年：\n🇹🇷 土耳其89.5万人\n🇬🇷 希腊6.56万人\n土耳其是希腊的13.65倍！\n\n100年间，两国出生人口差距扩大了近4倍。","url":"https://x.com/Stanley_Liu2018/status/2112602017894142060"},{"author_id":"60042536","created_at":"2026-10-20T01:30:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112355701742018575"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/huang3feng/sta…","end":31,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/huang3feng/status/2112068511380152534","start":8,"url":"https://t.co/yLy69MGxfH"}]},"id":"2112355701742018575","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":321,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"出生人口腰斩。 https://t.co/yLy69MGxfH","url":"https://x.com/keyemail/status/2112355701742018575"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112202278799081472","3_2112202278769754112"]},"author_id":"1811888010088316932","created_at":"2026-10-19T15:20:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112202291558424842"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/SpwP8iD79f","end":168,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/cuichenghao/status/2112202291558424842/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112202278799081472","start":145,"url":"https://t.co/SpwP8iD79f"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/SpwP8iD79f","end":168,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/cuichenghao/status/2112202291558424842/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112202278769754112","start":145,"url":"https://t.co/SpwP8iD79f"}]},"id":"2112202291558424842","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":53,"impression_count":26699,"like_count":205,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":30},"text":"这两张图放在一起，看着有点后背发凉。\n\n2016年，内地出生人口1786万，养老金涨幅6.5%。到了2025年，出生人口792万，养老金涨幅只剩2%。\n\n越来越明显的是，领养老金的人越来越多，未来缴费的人却越来越少。\n\n如今