1194248/status/2111930033308639696"},{"author_id":"1919750404776308736","created_at":"2026-10-20T02:16:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112367328524636187"],"id":"2112367328524636187","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":58,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国1960年 三年困难时期”的年代\n物资匮乏\n\n出生人口水平竟然与2026年现代一样！\n\n为什么都到了2026年，年轻人却越来越不愿意生孩子了？\n到底是年轻人变了，还是这个时代变了？","url":"https://x.com/ZREOVV/status/2112367328524636187"},{"author_id":"1793846410007449600","created_at":"2026-10-19T09:16:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112110652215238696"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/elonmusk/statu…","end":174,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/2112089556615123114","start":151,"url":"https://t.co/ZRe1Wn4GIw"}]},"id":"2112110652215238696","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":289,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"美国每年出生人口（CDC 数据）：2024 年约 362.9 万（3,628,934），比 2023 年的 359.6 万小幅涨了 1%。[7] 所以按这比例，马斯克要是明年真给每个孩子送一股，光一年出生的就有三百多万娃等着领，还不算以前那些\"孩子\"——这哪是送股票，这是嫌自己那几千万股太烫手了吧。 https://t.co/ZRe1Wn4GIw","url":"https://x.com/zerowq_eth/status/2112110652215238696"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112373241629057024"]},"author_id":"1165713500104212481","created_at":"2026-10-20T02:42:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112373935262072930"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/9iGYQR2xCx","end":159,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Jacob43817149/status/2112373935262072930/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112373241629057024","start":136,"url":"https://t.co/9iGYQR2xCx"}]},"id":"2112373935262072930","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":1567,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国的生育率已跌到约1.0甚至更低，远低于更替水平（2.1）。\n\n数据来自国家统计局历年统计公报。2025年全年出生人口官方数字是792万，出生率5.63‰，人口总量减少约339万，已是连续第四年负增长。\n\n联合国等机构预测，到本世纪末中国人口可能降至7-8亿甚至更低。 https://t.co/9iGYQR2xCx","url":"https://x.com/Jacob43817149/status/2112373935262072930"},{"author_id":"2461904027","created_at":"2026-10-20T05:53:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112421901545152724"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"（哈萨克国际通讯社讯）据乌兹别克斯坦国家统计委员会公布的数据，截至2026年10月1日，该国常住人口达到3954万人，较去年同期增加69.22万人，增长1.8%。","display_url":"cn.inform.kz/news/renyinian…","end":173,"expanded_url":"https://cn.inform.kz/news/renyinianchang70-ren3954-79a0897e","images":[{"height":1000,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112421976413446144/Fe9doI4L?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1600},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112421976413446144/Fe9doI4L?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":150,"status":200,"title":"乌兹别克斯坦人口一年增长近70万 总人口达3954万","unwound_url":"https://cn.inform.kz/news/renyinianchang70-ren3954-79a0897e/","url":"https://t.co/f7jJ6ux2wR"}]},"id":"2112421901545152724","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":52,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"📊 乌兹别克斯坦最新人口数据出炉！\n\n截至2026年10月1日，全国常住人口达到3954万人，同比增加69.22万人，增长1.8%。\n\n🏙️ 撒马尔罕州以446万人位居全国首位，费尔干纳州和塔什干州紧随其后，首都塔什干市人口达到328万人。\n\n该国年度出生人口自2020年以来首次降至90万人以下。\nhttps://t.co/f7jJ6ux2wR","url":"https://x.com/kazinform_chn/status/2112421901545152724"},{"author_id":"1893840739374886912","created_at":"2026-10-19T16:42:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112222941304033423"],"id":"2112222941304033423","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3394,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"麻了，山东今年考公考编过审56万人，去年全省出生人口才51万人。\n\n在山东，问汝平生功业，考研考公考编。\n\n当年山东郓城的一宋姓小吏，就是对进体制执念过甚，\n卖了100多位梁山兄弟，也才换个官职武德大夫，顶多算个处级干部，最后还被赐杯鸩酒。","url":"https://x.com/changkongwuji8/status/2112222941304033423"},{"author_id":"2031656947750223872","created_at":"2026-10-19T06:52:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112074301994365040"],"id":"2112074301994365040","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"养老金涨幅从10%跌到2%，这就是20年走完的下坡路。\n\n现在职工养老保险抚养比已经掉到2.6:1左右（过去是5-7个人养1个），可25年出生人口只有792万。\n\n养老金连涨是政治正确，继续涨就继续从年轻人身上砍，不涨老人又受不了。老爷们是得罪不起的，最终中登和老登们会等到互搏的那一天的。","url":"https://x.com/ChrickyLi/status/2112074301994365040"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2112177144642117632"]},"author_id":"1664408686381477897","created_at":"2026-10-19T23:40:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112327937814827044"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/LWxVj4c2b8","end":142,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Renminbao1/status/2112327937814827044/video/1","media_key":"13_2112177144642117632","start":119,"url":"https://t.co/LWxVj4c2b8"},{"display_url":"x.com/Renminbao1/sta…","end":166,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/Renminbao1/status/2112022116056895800","start":143,"url":"https://t.co/CGYH9ND9Df"}]},"id":"2112327937814827044","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":107,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"「東北10年流失1100萬人，相當於一個希臘的人口？」一名發言者指出，黑龍江、吉林、遼寧面臨出生人口減少、老齡化及人口外流等多重壓力。\n\n她更稱，東北三省在出生率、離婚率及死亡率等指標上排名突出，諷刺「東北人不生了、不過了，還不活了」。 https://t.co/LWxVj4c2b8 https://t.co/CGYH9ND9Df","url":"https://x.com/Renminbao1/status/2112327937814827044"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2112541081497931776"]},"author_id":"843721999813820416","created_at":"2026-10-20T13:47:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112541123541360913"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Y7SGBv4n9w","end":91,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ChinaTruthFiles/status/2112541123541360913/video/1","media_key":"13_2112541081497931776","start":68,"url":"https://t.co/Y7SGBv4n9w"}]},"id":"2112541123541360913","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":99,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"「東北10年流失1100萬人，相當於一個希臘的人口？」一名發言者指出，黑龍江、吉林、遼寧面臨出生人口減少、老齡化及人口外流等多重壓力。 https://t.co/Y7SGBv4n9w","url":"https://x.com/ChinaTruthFiles/status/2112541123541360913"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112005005935046656"]},"author_id":"1449103717081370630","created_at":"2026-10-19T02:16:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112005013707075898"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/hCnHcvA504","end":173,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Rishav2924/status/2112005013707075898/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112005005935046656","start":150,"url":"https://t.co/hCnHcvA504"}]},"id":"2112005013707075898","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":380,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我们史上最大的退休潮正在来临，我国60岁及以上人口超3.23亿、占总人口23%，其中失能老人约3600万、失智老人约1700万。为了让这部分老年人消费，专家们又整出一个新名词：银发经济。其实除了退休金上万的少部分老人，大部分老人经济并不宽裕，中国的老龄化是“未富先老”，所以也别盯着老人养老的那仨瓜 https://t.co/hCnHcvA504","url":"https://x.com/Rishav2924/status/2112005013707075898"},{"author_id":"2094689477667229697","created_at":"2026-10-19T10:05:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112122848437514595"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/xox_905/status…","end":153,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/xox_905/status/2111966830571196714","start":130,"url":"https://t.co/hDQ27FdBRW"}]},"id":"2112122848437514595","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":440,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我发现中国情况也很严重，只是比韩国稍微好一些：\n1、生育率：2025年出生人口792万（历史新低），总和生育率约1.0左右，人口连续第4年下降。\n2、婚姻：晚婚普遍，20岁左右未婚率近98%，25岁约74%。\n3、自杀率：约6-8/10万人，比日韩稍微好些。 https://t.co/hDQ27FdBRW","url":"https://x.com/Nakamurajoph/status/2112122848437514595"},{"author_id":"1864833977179344899","created_at":"2026-10-20T02:47:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112375080483500431"],"id":"2112375080483500431","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":77,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"近代中国自清帝退位之后，国运爆棚。虽屡有坎坷，但是在关乎国运的重大决策上，全部选择正确。\n最新的一次，依我看就是2020年之后的新出生人口数量断崖式下跌，碰巧踏中了历史的韵律。AI再发展下去，二十年以后没有人口红利，只有人口黑利。","url":"https://x.com/yuanshiwanqc/status/2112375080483500431"},{"author_id":"1930981328473952256","created_at":"2026-10-20T12:08:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112516185313186299"],"id":"2112516185313186299","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1575,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"居然还真有不少人担心，现在的人交了社保，由于自己交的钱给已经退休的人发了养老金，而以后出生人口减少了，等自己退休时，养老金就会发不出来了。","url":"https://x.com/Kongkongda5882/status/2112516185313186299"},{"author_id":"2031760158486085632","created_at":"2026-10-19T05:52:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112059245667422259"],"id":"2112059245667422259","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":59,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这些年我反复强调，拿孩子以后结婚总要买房，证明房子永远有人接，是已经过时的想法。\n\n2025 年全国出生人口 792 万，死亡人口 1131 万，总人口减少 339 万。这是国家统计局的数据。\n\n人口减少不等于每座城市都会少人。恰恰因为人还会继续迁移，我更反对在年轻人持续流出的地方囤投资房。","url":"https://x.com/YuzhiyanLucian/status/2112059245667422259"},{"author_id":"1530406379898695680","created_at":"2026-10-19T10:49:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112134016648544372"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/elonmusk/statu…","end":191,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/2112089556615123114","start":168,"url":"https://t.co/f01lYSM5v6"}]},"id":"2112134016648544372","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":168,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"💥有点炸！恶意赠送！！\n\n马斯克表示，明年将向美国每一名儿童赠送一股 SpaceX 股票。\n\nSpaceX 最新股价报 146.03 美元，总市值约 1.92 万亿美元。\n\n根据美国疾控中心（CDC）的最新统计，去年（ 2025 年）全美新出生人口约为 360.6 万人。\n\n​在实际测算中，得区分马斯克所说的“每一个孩子（every https://t.co/f01lYSM5v6","url":"https://x.com/pac8Mak1r/status/2112134016648544372"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112105763732946944"]},"author_id":"1787790772898783232","created_at":"2026-10-19T09:04:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112107141569839192","2112107688318357998"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/vclSxRvY2w","end":119,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Pink_Piglet002/status/2112107688318357998/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112105763732946944","start":96,"url":"https://t.co/vclSxRvY2w"}]},"id":"2112107688318357998","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10921